// F9b: CRASH (segmentation fault) of `mcad check`: union(fillet = 1) of a peg
// (cylinder d 6) and an equally thick sweep that starts at the end face of the peg
// (almost tangential circular edge). With union() no crash. Avoided in the key rack hook.
// Status (report 13): fixed – no crash, message about the corner (smlib/patches/0002).
// SOLL-FEHLER: cannot blend the corner
union(fillet = 1) {
    cylinder([0, 0, 0], [0, 8, 0], d = 6);
    sweep(path = [[0, 0, 0], [0, -13, -1], [0, -22, 4], [0, -23, 10]]) circle(d = 6);
}
